      "instance_name": "crowded_baboons_scene",
      "label": "crowded baboons scene",
      "description": "A densely packed crowd of baboons, many with open mouths, appearing to be vocalizing or shouting. Their fur is predominantly grayish-brown with lighter, almost white, facial skin and pinkish-red areas around the mouth and nose. The scene is chaotic and crowded, with monkeys in various poses—some looking upward, others facing sideways or forward. The image is overlaid with the text 'spot the difference', suggesting a visual puzzle. The baboons are the sole visual entities in the image, with no human or other animal presence.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
