      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad online audience familiar with internet meme formats, particularly the 'spot the difference' genre. The target community includes individuals who engage with visual puzzles and humor on social media platforms, without necessarily being aware of the historical racial implications tied to the primate imagery.",
